<title>USA: Etec buys Ebetech.</title>
<headline>Etec buys Ebetech.</headline>
<dateline>HAYWORD, Calif. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Etec Systems Inc said it acquired all the shares of Ebetech Electron-Beam Technology GmbH, from VCM, the venture capital company of Siemens AG, MRS Technology Inc, and a group of founding employees.</p>
<p>Ebetech is a Munich, Germany-based company that makes focused electron-beam test systems for flat panel displays and circuit boards.</p>
</text>
